        <tbody>
          <tr><td>LG Energy Solution</td><td>NMC (shifting to LFP)</td><td>Largest of the three; ~22% global EV share (2023 era)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Samsung SDI</td><td>NMC, prismatic</td><td>Premium EV + ESS</td></tr>
